BEGIN:VEVENT
ORGANIZER;CN="CSSZ":mailto:info@cssz.ch
SUMMARY:Meet'n'Dine 5 - Dumplings and Pilsner!
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/knedliky/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/WpyMr8Uv8sHp9nEg9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">University of Zurich, KOL-K-Küche</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Radim Urban (<a class="link" href="mailto:radim.urban@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">radim.urban@cssz.ch</a>), Aleš Kubiček (<a class="link" href="mailto:ales.kubicek@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ales.kubicek@cssz.ch</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://forms.gle/6J8HZN7weRa99Q739" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Waiting List</a>\n<strong>Notes:</strong>\n• <strong>We reached the event&rsquo;s capacity.</strong> Waiting list is now open. You will be notified by email if spots free up.\n\n<h2 id="its-that-time-of-the-year-again">It’s that time of the year again!!!</h2> <p>On October 23, we will meet in the beautiful kitchen space at UZH (K floor with incredible view over the oldtown and lake) and we’ll be cooking a traditional Czech dish: <em>Plněné knedlíky uzeným se zelím</em> (Stuffed dumplings with smoked cabbage). Czech Beer on tap is provided and included in your registration fee.</p> <p>  <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAAZCAIAAAC&#43;dZmEAAAFaElEQVR4nATAW28cVwEA4HPOnJnZue7MXhx7L2Nn1zbxrSqikR0lStIQpw0qQkiogr7xwgv8BR6QEEKCB16gSICQqFSB&#43;gQlgTaQxHZct8Vx8KXx2k18X&#43;&#43;ux7uzt9mZnZlzTj9Mgg5jDADAGEAcWn9RzySldEIGlCGEAACUUgghYwxCwBhgjEEIIGAAIIR4nhNinBDDYgxhpdamH605CHERpW6r1et2EQBBGAJCopAgnucEFfEy5TXG8XBvd9P3fQhREAStZsuIa3a9yUh0YWhwYnLKdTurn69aw5bv&#43;ZTRWEysVG0rpVp8mxl5&#43;Muf/XTx8ZIkS77nj44VPc/P5jKl7Z0bN69/&#43;WJvenry/ffeHxy6gDE&#43;PDjK5zJnbvTz7069Wv139PZvcHog3ev1EELpgZSqaRDCTDYzMDCQs3If/O0DVZFfefUV&#43;8yWZNlxnIGBlKlrUu4SEG14uIajMBIEQRTFXs/zel673XG7ru/79up5t&#43;v2er3nW891XWeMpdPpwO&#43;HhPOqB/T8BdFy8GS/1O50AABu1z04OFRVJQyjTDYjy9Ley71EMlE9rVrDlud5CCGMuZpdnylmR&#43;ApsObgr3/1C9/vx0RhZmb6zpt3aeQjLAAAAGA